==Counter-Surge==
'''Counter-Surge''' (烈波カウンター ''Reppa Kauntā'', '''Intense Wave Counter''')  is an ability introduced in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]]. It activates when a Surge hits the user, and consists of an animation in which a one-eyed soul with a colored aura (blue for cats, pink for enemies) appears above the user, jitters for a moment, and fires off a Surge from its eye before returning to the user's body, taking 1.7 seconds to execute. The Surge's level, size (normal or Mini) and spawn area are inherited from the attack that struck it, while any damage and secondary effects are scaled to that of the user itself. Unlike with Death Surge, this Surge is considered to be generated by the user itself, and as such, Weaken/Curse effects that have afflicted the unit will affect the spawned Surge. If said effects wear off before the Surge expires, their effects on the Surge are likewise removed.

When used by multi-hit attackers like [[Kappy Kawano]], this ability inherits damage and other effects from the first hit. For example, Kappy Kawano's 114k damage is divided into three closely-spaced multi-hits dealing 38k damage each. As such, if a Surge hits him, the resultant Counter-Surge will only deal 38k damage.

Note that units with Counter-Surge still receive full damage from Surge Attacks. Also, Counter-Surges are not generated unless the enemy takes direct damage from a Surge Attack. This means that if an enemy is protected by a [[Shield]] which absorbs the full damage of the Surge, the enemy will not create a Counter-Surge.

To prevent a continuous loop, Counter-Surges cannot trigger the Counter-Surge ability itself. I.e., if [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Phantasmal Nobunaga]] hits Kappy Kawano with a copied Surge, it won't trigger Kawano's Counter-Surge.

Every second unit deployed with a Single Surge Counter [[Talent Orbs|Orb]] gains a single use of Counter-Surge that deals less damage than normal, unless at Rank S. When two Single Surge Counter Orbs are equipped by the same unit, only one takes effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority. When a unit is set to gain the Single Surge Counter ability, its deployment button will briefly flash and a small icon of the Orb will appear on the top-left corner of it. This Orb cannot be equipped by [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Cats with Surge Immunity]]. However, if a Cat has Surge Immunity Talent that isn't yet unlocked and is equipped with a Single Surge Counter orb, players still can unlock the Talent without removing the Orb (but the Orb still can't create any Counter-Surge).

