==Trivia==
*[[Kappy Jr.]] and [[Kasli the Scourge (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli the Scourge]] were the first enemy and cat respectively to have Surge Attacks.
*Just like with [[Wave Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s, enemies will create blue Surges, while cats will create pink Surges.
*Cats' Mini-Deathsurge soul has ears, while enemies' Death Surge soul has horns.
*If a unit creates a Surge while [[Curse|cursed]], its ability will be activated on the Surge after the curse wears off.
**In the case of [[Elder Flame Doron]], a well-timed Curseblast can result in the Surge never applying any status effects if Doron despawns before the Curse effect wears off.
*If a [[:Category:Focused Target Cats|unit with the Attacks Only ability]] creates a Surge, its Surge will be able to damage units outside of its target trait/s. This is currently only applicable to [[Backhoe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Backhoe Cat]].
*The Death Surge ability was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]], but was unimplemented and lacked an animation until [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].
*For enemies such as [[Sinner Snache]] who have a non-100% chance of Death Surge, a normal soul will appear when Death Surge does not trigger while an Aku soul appears when it does trigger. This makes Sinner Snache the only enemy with two different death animations.
*Death Surge is similar to the Vain Struggle (わるあがき ''Waruagaki'') ability from [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou]], which dealt a set % of the user's attack power as area damage upon death.
*[[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Phantasmal Nobunaga]] was the first [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] to have the [[Counter-Surge]] ability.
*The soul that appears when the Counter-Surge ability activates resembles the top of the [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]] (which itself appears to be modeled after the [[wikipedia:Monument to the Revolution of the people of Moslavina|Monument to the Revolution of the people of Moslavina]] in Croatia), as well as the boss [https://wikirby.com/wiki/0%C2%B2 0²] from ''[https://wikirby.com/wiki/Kirby_64:_The_Crystal_Shards Kirby 64: The Crystal Shards]''.

